# harvest/ is a LOCAL WORK AREA. It is deliberately not tracked.
#
# THE REASON THIS FILE EXISTS: this repository is PUBLIC (GitHub Pages serves
# it), and harvest/ contains a real contact export -- names, phone numbers and
# email addresses of actual people. A casual `git add harvest/` would publish
# customer PII to the open internet. Do not remove this rule to "just commit
# the data files".
#
# What is in there, by kind:
#   NEVER COMMIT   Export_Contacts_real_*.csv        real PII
#   ALREADY RESCUED  the keyed Czech dictionary used to live at
#                  harvest/locales/cs-CZ.json. It is authored work that cannot
#                  be refetched, so it now lives TRACKED at lang/cs-CZ.keys.json,
#                  beside the pack it generates. Do not put a copy back here.
#   STILL UNTRACKED AND IRREPLACEABLE
#                  locales/*-cs.js (per-module authoring sources, with their
#                  __fix / __asIs annotations) and harvester.js. Superseded by
#                  cs-CZ.keys.json for regeneration, but keep a backup off this
#                  machine if the authoring history matters.
#   REGENERABLE    locales/en-flat.json, en-US.json, and the 12 locale JSONs
#                  -> refetched in ~2 min from HighLevel's public, unauthenticated
#                     localization API. Losing them costs nothing.
#   DISPOSABLE     *.tsv, srape/, untranslated-*.txt, v25-*.txt  -> analysis scratch
harvest/

# Never, under any circumstances, in a public repo.
*.csv
Export_Contacts_*
seed-contacts*

# local scratch
*.log
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
